RESOLUTION NO.  _______

ENTITLED: “A RESOLUTION ADOPTING AN AMENDMENT TO THE FUTURE
LAND USE MAP IN PLANCHEYENNE, THE MASTER PLAN FOR THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE AND THE COMPREHENSIVE PLAN FOR
PORTIONS OF LARAMIE COUNTY, AMENDING THE LAND USE
CATEGORY
FROM
COMMUNITY
BUSINESS
TO
URBAN
RESIDENTIAL FOR ALL OF LOT 2 AND A PORTION OF LOT 3,
BLOCK 1, SADDLE RIDGE SUBDIVISION, CHEYENNE, WYOMING,
TO BE KNOWN AS SADDLE RIDGE 7th FILING (LOCATED AT THE
SOUTHEAST CORNER OF THE INTERSECTION OF US HIGHWAY 30
AND WHITNEY ROAD).”

WHEREAS, PlanCheyenne, as amended by PlanCheyenne: Reflections and Progress
adopted by the Governing Body of the City of Cheyenne by Resolution No. 5573, is the Master
Plan for the City of Cheyenne and the Comprehensive Plan for portions of Laramie County
adopted by both the Governing Body of the City of Cheyenne and Laramie County Board of
County Commissioners; and

WHEREAS, the intent of the Future Land Use plan is not to predetermine specific land
uses for individual parcels or specific locations for uses or facilities, but to provide a general
framework for neighborhoods and activity centers organized around  roadway networks and
major parks and open space; and

WHEREAS, Saddle Ridge, LLC, property owner, has initiated an amendment to the
Future Land Use map to amend the land use category from Community Business to Urban
Residential for all of Lot 2 and a portion of Lot 3, Block 1, Saddle Ridge Subdivision, Cheyenne,
Wyoming, to be known as Saddle Ridge 7th Filing (located at the southeast corner of the
intersection of US Highway 30 and Whitney Road); and

WHEREAS, Plan Amendments approved by the Governing Body pursuant to the criteria
set forth on Page 18 of Plan Cheyenne, as amended; and

WHEREAS, the Laramie County Planning and Zoning Department, under the authority
of the Laramie County Board of County Commissioners, reviewed the proposed future land use
map amendment and made comments that were forwarded onto the City of Cheyenne; and

WHEREAS, a public hearing to receive public input and comments on the proposed
Future Land Use map amendment for the above described property was held before the City of
Cheyenne Planning Commission on August 5, 2015 and the Commission subsequently
recommended adoption of the proposed PlanCheyenne Future Land Use map amendment; and

WHEREAS, Plan Amendment processes and procedures required by Plan Cheyenne, as
amended, have been followed with regard to the request by Saddle Ridge, LLC to amend the
Future Land Use map category for the above described property.

NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING that the request submitted by Saddle Ridge, LLC,
property owner, to change the land category for all of Lot 2 and a portion of Lot 3, Block 1,
Saddle Ridge Subdivision, Cheyenne, Wyoming, to be known as Saddle Ridge 7th Filing (located
at the southeast corner of the intersection of US Highway 30 and Whitney Road), is hereby
approved; and

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF
CHEYENNE, WYOMING, that an amendment to the Future Land Use Map contained in
PlanCheyenne, as amended by Resolution No. 5573, is hereby adopted to change the land use
category from Community Business to Urban Residential for all of Lot 2 and a portion of Lot 3,
Block 1, Saddle Ridge Subdivision, Cheyenne, Wyoming, to be known as Saddle Ridge, 7th
Filing (located at the southeast corner of the intersection of US Highway 30 and Whitney Road),
as indicated on Exhibit A attached with this Resolution.

PRESENTED, READ AND ADOPTED THIS           DAY OF                        , 2015.
```

